--!strict
--[[
	EnemyConfig
	Enemy archetypes. Health and Damage are expressed "at equal size": the
	actual numbers in a fight are scaled by CombatMath.sizeAdvantage, so the
	same ant is a real threat to a microscopic player and a speck to a titan.

	Speed / ranges are in the enemy's own body lengths (height = 5 × Scale),
	which keeps behaviour readable across a 1000× size range.
	Rewards are multiplied by the zone RewardScale and by
	CombatMath.rewardFactor (no farming far-smaller enemies).
]]

